{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01199V3CFSp9z8q6AmPqwZLT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the task. I need to create two PRD files for the `true` and `false` utilities. Let me first read the existing PRD files to understand the format, then create the new ones.\n\nThe task says to review the required reading files. Let me check what's already provided in the project_context and what I need to read from disk.\n\nFrom the project_context, I have:\n- docs/ARCHITECTURE.yaml - provided inline\n- docs/VISION.yaml - provided inline\n\nI need to read:\n- docs/specs/product-requirements/prd005-wc.yaml (PRD format reference)\n\n\n- docs/specs/product-requirements/prd006-cat.yaml (PRD format reference)\n\nThese aren't provided in the project_context source_code section, so I'll need to read them from disk to understand the PRD structure and format before creating the new files.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":97907,"cache_read_input_tokens":16066,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":97907},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7d60d98e-2c55-476a-91fa-87a9ea5b4b77","uuid":"1993ee7e-eb9f-4c03-b61e-d138e7de7902"}
